    Item:        <ansi fg="item">Core Guardian Heart</ansi>
    Description: <ansi fg="itemdesc">Drawn from the deepest of the guardians, the one that stood
                 over the place where all the buried quiet gathers. It is a
                 fist of grey material folded around a single mote of trapped
                 brightness, and it is never wholly still -- the light within
                 drifts and settles like something breathing in its sleep.
                 Hold it and you feel a slow pulse answer in your own wrist,
                 patient and enormous. Whatever it once guarded, it guards
                 its last warmth now. A relic beyond price, fit only for work
                 that will outlast the one who makes it.</ansi>

